Mark, here is the combined comparison. I recommend Kowale.

Kowale is EUR 8,400 per month cheaper in rent (EUR 100,800 per year). The lon=
ger distance adds cost: Tom's estimate is about 25 port shuttle moves per wee=
k, each roughly EUR 14 more expensive, so around EUR 1,500 per month extra. N=
et saving is still about EUR 6,900 per month, around EUR 82,800 per year. On =
top of that Kowale gives us 14 docks instead of 10 and 10.5 m clear height in=
stead of 9 m, plus 1 month rent-free.

Main risk is the 28 km distance to the port.

Criterion | Port Logistics Park | Kowale
Rent EUR/m2/month | 4.80 | 4.10
Dock doors | 10 | 14
Clear height | 9 m | 10.5 m
Distance to port | 6 km | 28 km
Rent-free | none | 1 month
Extra shuttle cost | 0 | approx. EUR 1,500/month

Regards,
